      "content": "So $F_x = 500\\cos 80^\circ + 200\\cos 30^\circ - 300\\cos 60^\circ = 110{,}03\\text{ N}$ and $F_y = 500\\sin 80^\circ + 200\\sin 30^\circ - 300\\sin 60^\circ = 332{,}60\\text{ N}$. How do I combine them?"
